<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-117" chapter-id="c-jinshu-117-jin067-xitan-xihui" source-id="s-jinshu-117-jin067-xitan-xihui">
  <p id="c-jinshu-117-jin067-xitan-xihui:identity" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-117-jin067-xitan-xihui:identity:m0000" ref="b58_fbc_4e6">姚興</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-117-jin067-xitan-xihui:identity:m0004" ref="b58_fbc_4e6">子略</persName>，<persName id="c-jinshu-117-jin067-xitan-xihui:identity:m0007" ref="xse_vcr_aju">萇</persName>之長子也。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-117-jin067-xitan-xihui:campaign" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-117-jin067-xitan-xihui:campaign:m0000" ref="b58_fbc_4e6">興</persName>率眾寇湖城，晉弘農太守<persName id="c-jinshu-117-jin067-xitan-xihui:campaign:m0012" ref="t5s_ghk_fi2">陶仲山</persName>、華山太守<persName id="c-jinshu-117-jin067-xitan-xihui:campaign:m0020" ref="ltp_48x_5vl">董邁</persName>皆降於<persName id="c-jinshu-117-jin067-xitan-xihui:campaign:m0025" ref="b58_fbc_4e6">興</persName>。遂如陝城，進寇上洛，陷之。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-117-jin067-xitan-xihui:luoyang" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">遣<persName id="c-jinshu-117-jin067-xitan-xihui:luoyang:m0001" ref="ink_v1i_ex8">姚崇</persName>寇洛陽，晉河南太守<persName id="c-jinshu-117-jin067-xitan-xihui:luoyang:m0012" ref="ayu_mbl_2zo">夏侯宗之</persName>固守金墉，<persName id="c-jinshu-117-jin067-xitan-xihui:luoyang:m0021" ref="ink_v1i_ex8">崇</persName>攻之不克</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-117-jin067-xitan-xihui:later" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-117-jin067-xitan-xihui:later:m0000" ref="b58_fbc_4e6">興</persName>遣將鎮東<persName id="c-jinshu-117-jin067-xitan-xihui:later:m0005" ref="5in_4zv_6wi">楊佛嵩</persName>攻陷洛陽。</p>
</text>
